---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Features — Fornax">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <h1>What Fornax does for your business</h1>
    <p class="tagline">A site built for your trade, leads that reach you in real time, and a CRM sync that keeps your pipeline current — without you touching a website builder.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-block">
    <h2>Lead Generation Engine</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Scoring, not guesswork</h3>
        <p>Every prospect and every lead is scored so effort goes where it converts, and your tier is assigned to match your business rather than a self-service picker.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Real-time push</h3>
        <p>Form submissions and click-to-call events land in your dashboard as they happen, not in a weekly digest.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>CRM auto-create</h3>
        <p>On SMB, a new lead becomes a record in your CRM automatically — no manual re-entry.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-block feature-block-alt">
    <h2>AI-Designed Websites</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Brand preserved, not replaced</h3>
        <p>Your logo, colors and service area drive the design — we don't hand you a generic template.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>8-10 styling profiles</h3>
        <p>Each generated site is resolved through a styling profile matched to your trade and brand, not a single one-size-fits-all theme.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>One-click customization</h3>
        <p>Within your plan, adjust text, images, contact details and (on SMB) colors and fonts — no code, no separate editor to learn.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Professional Redesign (waitlist)</h3>
        <p>Want deeper layout changes? Our human-executed redesign service is available as an add-on, currently waitlisted.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-block">
    <h2>CRM Integrations</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Top trades CRMs</h3>
        <p>HubSpot first at launch, with Jobber, ServiceTitan, Housecall Pro and Successware planned next.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>One-way sync at launch</h3>
        <p>New leads push into your CRM automatically. A feedback loop back into your dashboard is on the roadmap.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-block feature-block-alt">
    <h2>Analytics &amp; Reporting</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Dashboard</h3>
        <p>See every lead, its source, and its status in one place.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Monthly report</h3>
        <p>A recurring summary of leads, site performance and search visibility.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>ROI calculator</h3>
        <p>Plan-level tooling to see what your site is worth against its cost — coming as reporting matures.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-block">
    <h2>Customer Support</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Email support</h3>
        <p>Published response times of 24-48 hours on Managed plans.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Help center</h3>
        <p>Public docs for getting started, CRM setup per integration, troubleshooting and best practices — see <a href="/docs">Docs</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-footer">
    <h2>See it on your own business</h2>
    <p>Request a demo and we'll show you the actual site and dashboard, not a mockup.</p>
    <a href="/demo" class="button button-primary">Get my demo</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 60px 20px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: 40px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }

  .tagline {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .feature-block {
    padding: 48px 20px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .feature-block-alt {
    background: #f9f9f9;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .feature-block-alt > * {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .feature-block h2 {
    font-size: 28px;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .feature-card {
    padding: 24px;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
  }

  .feature-block-alt .feature-card {
    background: white;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .cta-footer {
    text-align: center;
    background: #f9f9f9;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 40px auto 60px;
  }

  .cta-footer h2 {
    font-size: 32px;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .cta-footer p {
    color: #666;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  .button {
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 16px;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .button-primary {
    background: #dc2626;
    color: white;
  }

  .button-primary:hover {
    background: #b91c1c;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
